1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,800
Woman: There's a lot of buzz about the new Italian restaurant downtown

2
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,200
though the reviews are decidedly mixed.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,504
Man: One of my neighbors said his pasta was seasoned to perfection,

4
00:00:13,504 --> 00:00:17,090
while another thought they overdid it with the olive oil.

5
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:19,240
Woman: Maybe we should figure it out for ourselves

6
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,040
How about this Saturday? I could make a reservation.

7
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:28,060
Man: That day? I have some family members coming over to my house for dinner. Sorry.
